{"questions":[{"questionType":"mcq","difficulty":"medium","minForm":4,"course":"core","subcategory":"transformed-polynomials","skill":"poly-substitution","stem":"Let \\(f(x)=2x^2+3x-5\\) and \\(g(x)=f(x^2+1)\\). Find the remainder when \\(g(x)\\) is divided by \\(x-3\\).","stemZh":"設 \\(f(x)=2x^2+3x-5\\)、\\(g(x)=f(x^2+1)\\)。求 \\(g(x)\\) 除以 \\(x-3\\) 的餘式。","solution":"The remainder is \\(g(3)=f(10)\\). Hence \\[\\begin{gathered}2(10)^2 +3(10) -5 \\\\ =225\\end{gathered}\\]","solutionZh":"餘式為 \\(g(3)=f(10)\\)，所以 \\[\\begin{gathered}2(10)^2 +3(10) -5 \\\\ =225\\end{gathered}\\]","solutionStatus":"independently-rederived","source":"S4/more about polynomials/S4 polynomials review.pdf · Q5","sourceZh":"S4/more about polynomials/S4 polynomials review.pdf · 第5題","level":"free","provenance":{"collection":"by-topic-review-materials","sourceId":"source-a11ea3a915f0b682","sha256":"641341ccab25c3ecd24c89de877aa77122fc326ddf7de3bbd74df10a8e926c97","file":"S4/more about polynomials/S4 polynomials review.pdf","number":"5","page":1,"attributionStatus":"not-supplied","intakeStage":"polynomial-bulk-2026-11-15"},"classification":{"version":"solving-method-v1","basis":"reviewed-decisive-solving-method","status":"editor-pipeline-reviewed","difficultyReason":"Evaluate the inner input first, then apply the remainder theorem.","evidence":"docs/qa/2026-11-15/polynomial-batch/mathematics.json#source-a11ea3a915f0b682-Q5"},"options":{"A":"225","B":"22","C":"\\(-235\\)","D":"4"},"optionsZh":{"A":"225","B":"22","C":"\\(-235\\)","D":"4"},"answer":"A","id":"import-polynomial-13b1a4fdf43e3a50","topicId":"polynomial","category":"calculation"},{"questionType":"mcq","difficulty":"medium","minForm":4,"course":"core","subcategory":"transformed-polynomials","skill":"poly-substitution","stem":"Let \\(g(x)\\) be a polynomial divisible by \\(x+1\\). Then \\(g(4x-5)\\) must be divisible by which expression?","stemZh":"設多項式 \\(g(x)\\) 可被 \\(x+1\\) 整除，則 \\(g(4x-5)\\) 必可被下列哪個式子整除？","solution":"Since \\(g(-1)=0\\